        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mad Lab Roulette is a psychological survival game based on probability, where participants trapped in a mysterious lab fight to be the last one standing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with AI or friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a deadly game of Russian roulette. Your opponent could be AI, a friend, or a complete stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who will you aim at?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The odds are visible. Now it's your turn to choose: will you point the gun at yourself or at someone else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705480/extras/2290c3871bfce446982b2cb0371c7fb1.avif?t=1785449755\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rising tension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every missed shot raises the fear. When a bullet doesn't fire, the chance it will next time increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705480/extras/329165def6e14faf026df8564b925fa0.avif?t=1785449755\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power of items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just luck it’s strategy. Use a variety of items to shift the odds and disrupt your opponents.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705480/extras/76749bc79ea2c28a9905864ba7badd5a.avif?t=1785449755\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mad Lab Roulette is a psychological survival game based on probability, where participants trapped in a mysterious lab fight to be the last one standing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with AI or friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a deadly game of Russian roulette. Your opponent could be AI, a friend, or a complete stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who will you aim at?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The odds are visible. Now it's your turn to choose: will you point the gun at yourself or at someone else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705480/extras/2290c3871bfce446982b2cb0371c7fb1.avif?t=1785449755\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rising tension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every missed shot raises the fear. When a bullet doesn't fire, the chance it will next time increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705480/extras/329165def6e14faf026df8564b925fa0.avif?t=1785449755\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power of items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just luck it’s strategy. Use a variety of items to shift the odds and disrupt your opponents.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705480/extras/76749bc79ea2c28a9905864ba7badd5a.avif?t=1785449755\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>",
